## Bench cycle count for this run
Five full-bench PDU power cycles (stk_a x3 outlets 4/5/6, swi_b 8, swi_e 7, swi_f 1), one after
each of TestCase_8..12, ~4 min each to all-ports-running. Accepted framework behaviour
(STANDING-ORDERS §6); what made it wasteful was the script grading an absent OPTIONAL role as
FAIL — the 3454bc0 exclusion is what the re-run must show.

